<body>

<header>

<h1>🔒 Privacy Policy</h1>

<p>GoodLeaders Platform</p>

</header>

<div class="container">

<div class="card">

<h2>1. Introduction</h2>

<p>
Welcome to GoodLeaders. We respect your privacy and are committed to
protecting the information you provide when using our platform.
</p>

<p>
This Privacy Policy explains what information may be collected and how
that information may be used.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>2. Information We Collect</h2>

<p>
When you create an account or use certain features of GoodLeaders, we
may collect information such as:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Your name or username</li>
<li>Email address</li>
<li>Phone number, if provided</li>
<li>Country, if provided</li>
<li>Messages submitted through our Contact Us form</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>3. How We Use Information</h2>

<p>
Information may be used to:
</p>

<ul>
<li>Create and manage user accounts</li>
<li>Provide GoodLeaders services</li>
<li>Respond to contact messages</li>
<li>Improve the platform</li>
<li>Maintain platform security</li>
<li>Communicate important information about the service</li>
</ul>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>4. Contact Messages</h2>

<p>
When you send a message through our Contact Us form, the name, email
address and message you provide may be stored by GoodLeaders so that
the appropriate administrator can review and respond to your request.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>5. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders may use cookies or similar technologies to help maintain
user sessions, remember necessary settings and improve the experience
of the website.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>6. Advertising</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders may display advertisements from third-party advertising
services in the future. These services may use cookies or similar
technologies to provide and measure advertisements in accordance with
their own policies.
</p>

<p>
If advertising is enabled, visitors should review the applicable
advertising provider's privacy information for details about how
advertising data may be handled.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>7. Data Security</h2>

<p>
We take reasonable steps to protect information stored by the platform.
However, no online service can guarantee absolute security.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>8. Third-Party Services</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders may use third-party services for hosting, analytics,
advertising or other website functions. Those services may have their
own privacy policies and terms.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>9. Children's Privacy</h2>

<p>
GoodLeaders is not intended to knowingly collect personal information
from children in violation of applicable laws. If you believe a child
has provided personal information improperly, please contact us so the
information can be reviewed.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>10. Changes to This Policy</h2>

<p>
This Privacy Policy may be updated from time to time as GoodLeaders
develops new features or services. Updates will be reflected on this
page.
</p>

</div>

<div class="card">

<h2>11. Contact Us</h2>

<p>
If you have questions about this Privacy Policy, please contact us
through the GoodLeaders Contact Us page.
</p>

<a href="/contact" class="btn">
📩 Contact Us
</a>

